# AS-IS Process – Patient Appointment Management

Patient wants to book appointment
↓
Patient contacts hospital / appointment desk
↓
Receptionist checks doctor availability
↓
Available appointment slot selected
↓
Appointment entered into hospital system
↓
Patient receives appointment details
↓
Patient waits for appointment date
↓
**Does the patient attend?**

**YES** → Doctor consultation → Appointment completed

**NO** → No-show recorded → Appointment slot remains unused

## Current Process Challenges

* Patients may forget appointments
* Limited appointment reminders
* No simple appointment confirmation
* Rescheduling may require staff assistance
* Cancellation reasons may not be consistently captured
* Manual staff follow-up
* Limited visibility into no-show trends
